 <woodyst@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 1 Aug 2026 13:09:01 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 068/106] ASoC: qcom: q6dsp: puerto SLIMBUS_7 completo para el
 audio BT

q6afe/q6afe-dai/q6dsp-lpass-ports/q6routing + rutas de voz en
q6voice-dai + hw_params de SLIMBus en sm8250.c (mapa de canales al DSP,
como sdm845). IDs al final del array (149/150, ABI del DT) y respetando
la paridad par=RX/impar=TX de q6slim_set_channel_map.
---
 .../sound/qcom,q6dsp-lpass-ports.h            | 15 +++++
 sound/soc/qcom/common.h                       |  2 +-
 sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6afe-dai.c              |  7 +++
 sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6afe.c                  |  8 +++
 sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6dsp-lpass-ports.c      | 32 +++++++++++
 sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6routing.c              | 12 ++++
 sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6voice-dai.c            | 20 +++++++
 sound/soc/qcom/sm8250.c                       | 57 ++++++++++++++++++-
 8 files changed, 151 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/include/dt-bindings/sound/qcom,q6dsp-lpass-ports.h b/include/dt-bindings/sound/qcom,q6dsp-lpass-ports.h
index 45850f2d4..2c92caf6e 100644
--- a/include/dt-bindings/sound/qcom,q6dsp-lpass-ports.h
+++ b/include/dt-bindings/sound/qcom,q6dsp-lpass-ports.h
@@ -153,6 +153,21 @@
 #define SENARY_MI2S_RX		147
 #define SENARY_MI2S_TX		148
 
+/*
+ * SLIMBUS_7 is where the WCN399x Bluetooth chip's SCO ports live. It gets
+ * appended here rather than slotted in after SLIMBUS_6, because these numbers
+ * are device tree ABI and array indices: renumbering everything after it would
+ * silently repoint every existing board's ports.
+ *
+ * The values are not arbitrary. Code infers a port's direction from the parity
+ * of its id - q6slim_set_channel_map() reads a port as TX when (id & 1) - so
+ * RX has to stay even and TX odd. Numbering these 149/150 instead makes the
+ * DSP reject the channel map for the playback port with -EINVAL. 149 is left
+ * unused for that reason.
+ */
+#define SLIMBUS_7_RX		150
+#define SLIMBUS_7_TX		151
+
 #define LPASS_CLK_ID_PRI_MI2S_IBIT	1
 #define LPASS_CLK_ID_PRI_MI2S_EBIT	2
 #define LPASS_CLK_ID_SEC_MI2S_IBIT	3
